2610083889023237.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T19:36:09.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}],"followUp":"2026-10-08","citationId":"sfobswhd923x0ln147idyl12g"}]},{"label":"股票市场","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"特朗普8月买入至多2500万美元Meta股票和500万美元SpaceX债券","summary":"美国总统特朗普披露8月进行517笔证券交易，其中包括买入价值500万至2500万美元的Meta股票，以及买入价值100万至500万美元、票息5.35%并于2031年7月到期的SpaceX高级无担保票据。特朗普的账户当月买入额至少为4420万美元、卖出额至少为3010万美元；他在买入SpaceX票据两天后签署了扩大美国商业航天运输的政策。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/08/trump-august-trades-meta-spacex-financial-disclosure.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T13:18:47.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"b8623pzm8ppu1gk59ijz7mj0l"}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":"u81q4911rtnipir9p5gn39gd1","title":"安踏完成收购彪马29.06%股权，彪马能否成为下一个FILA？","summary":"安踏集团完成对德国运动品牌彪马29.06%股权的收购，现金对价为15.055亿欧元（约合人民币123亿元），交易已获全部监管批准并完成交割，安踏成为彪马第一大股东。彪马2025财年销售额经汇率调整后下降8.1%至72.96亿欧元，EBIT为-3.57亿欧元。文章认为，安踏可借助中国市场渠道和多品牌运营经验推动彪马转型，但彪马亏损及安踏持股比例不足以单独控制经营，也带来整合和盈利压力。","sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15168866.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T10:52:14.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a