Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"citationId":"o19lfyv903y1txvot7oldqviz"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国政府地址转出12267枚BTC，价值约10.1亿美元","summary":"PANews称，据Arkham及链上数据，北京时间10月8日21:33，标记为“美国政府：Bitfinex黑客被没收资金”的地址转出12267.02枚BTC，价值约10.1亿美元。其中6000枚分两笔转入新地址33pYK…cFk，剩余约6267枚暂存于另一新地址；此前两日，美国政府相关地址已累计向Coinbase Prime转入逾6200枚BTC。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11bc6-bd4a-7576-bff2-f579ec823ba4","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T13:49:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":4,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"美国政府地址向Coinbase转入4.48亿美元BTC，32小时累计转移6.7亿美元加密资产","summary":null,"sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a118dc-da0d-71da-b339-e9044bb5c8c2","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T00:14:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"m8add5xw6xrxh0o7bqxlt0fz9"}],"citationId":"d1d1wft0fo5x9hb3bo8gykhja"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"特朗普称中期选举前不会攻击伊朗，封锁将继续","summary":"特朗普在 Truth Social 发帖称，美国正与伊朗进行谈判，11月3日美国中期选举前不会对伊朗发动攻击。特朗普表示对伊朗的封锁将继续全面生效，并称伊朗不会拥有核武器；他还提到昨晚经霍尔木兹海峡运输的石油达2200万桶，且均与伊朗无关。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11c8a-14f2-71f2-8119-e24ee246c824","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T17:21:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7d7829b963afe835d4c9469a5d6120eb74c71d1e68c29cdeefc94446a6c51266.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bea8e42ecaae675437f1d85767b96c288a979621c45bc55640df59c09fbb8bcb.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"特朗普称美国不会在中期选举前攻击伊朗后金价上涨","summary":null,"sourceName":"Bloomberg Markets","sourceUrl":"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-10-07/gold-near-nine-week-low-on-prospects-for-rate-hike-by-year-end","publishedAt":"2026-10-07T23:37:27.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"bwjslpzpbg1r9os4x9tx5f83h"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"特朗普称11月3日中期选举前不会攻击伊朗，美伊继续间接谈判","summary":null,"sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783218","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T19:33:33.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"dx3niu0ur7r75u1cvrw0edsm2"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d16