l":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/08/spacex-spectrum-license-att-verizon-tmobile.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T21:10:09.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"dl3t8nlhwh2c0cteuco0za9w9"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"纽约陪审团裁定Uranium Finance黑客有罪，最高面临20年监禁","summary":"纽约陪审团裁定网络安全顾问Jonathan Spalletta因2021年两次攻击Uranium Finance而有罪，该平台约5500万美元资产被盗后停止运营。其涉及使用Tornado Cash等加密混币服务的洗钱罪名最高可判20年监禁，美国地区法官Jed Rakoff将量刑日期定于明年2月16日。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11969-9305-723e-bd5f-69903c14c6c1","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T02:48:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"j6jzxlryohp4557448yrtrzdl"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"法国将释放10 million barrels战略柴油储备以缓解生活成本压力","summary":"法国总理塞巴斯蒂安·勒科尔尼表示，政府将按成本价释放10 million barrels战略柴油储备，以缓解学生抗议和生活成本压力，预计柴油泵价每升下降12 to 18 euro cents。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/08/france-diesel-reserves-protests.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T09:16:41.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"t22lpu0qh5wcmgtj6yjgilqoa"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2cd8f96042d65c570d5aeba09ed82b994df30d57b7996e76abd7c263e69143ac.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/bc82872ab80bd258d69d49d64a7d4596a29573dde9d7d58caf156856440a2559.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"沙特与胡塞冲突升级，利雅得传出爆炸声并出现航班延误","summary":"也门胡塞武装加大对沙特首都利雅得的袭击，机场航班延误，部分企业要求员工居家办公。胡塞武装称向利雅得机场发射弹道导弹；沙特方面称本周利雅得机场和阿卜哈机场遇袭已造成3人死亡。冲突重燃以来，胡塞武装夺取红海沿岸部分地区，战事已造成200,000人流离失所，叙利亚正考虑提供军事支持。","sourceName":"CNBC Top News","sourceUrl":"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/08/booms-flight-disruptions-riyadh-saudi-houthi-war-escalates.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T14:47:36.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"h00w8rxwawg6iklbl0fzrdg2y"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"吉尔吉斯斯坦政府终止USDKG运营并清算EVA与Coin Nomad Exchange","summary":"吉尔吉斯斯坦政府决定终止国家稳定币Gold Dollar（USDKG）的运营，并要求财政部清算发行方EVA及国有加密货币交易所Coin Nomad Exchange。USDKG于2025年11月推出，实物黄金背书、1:1锚定美元，注册发行量略超5000万枚，运行在Tron区块链上。持有人可将USDKG兑换为法币或USDT。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a11958-89f4-727b-89cc-4088656c42ff","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T02:29:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"citationId":"lgz02dm9a4jwlw4wrl1hopkjd"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/37d4e70beec4574e9b457f547ecba779ae6a3ec96ca2f9d4a852ac50e9715247.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/c805ddc63768b4f0fa179b6390f69b3d1685a403018bf6443a0365d5673b4862.webp 96w","itemId":"aj0zw6anru8rx2a3334fwmaov","title":"AMD宣布以约82亿美元收购World Labs，李飞飞将加入任首席科学家","summary":"AMD宣布以约82亿美元全股票收购World Labs，交易预计于2026年底前完成，尚需获得监管批准。交易完成后，李飞飞将加入AMD担任执行副总裁兼首席科学家，World Labs团队将继续推进世界模型和空间智能研究。World Labs的Atlas目前仍处于面向少数合作伙伴的早期访问阶段，收入和客户规模尚未披露。","sourceName":"界面新闻","sourceUrl":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15168359.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-08T08:55:24.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":10,"firstPartyEvents":11},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-10-08","next":"2026-10-10"}